CLI.md §3.5, API.md B5, DECISIONS 449: stage A's W4001 (values a broken record leaves unevaluated)
is reported by canon test as by canon check, beside the phase-2 errors that broke the record.
-- args --
test
a
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// R.
record R {
  /// X.
  x: Missing
}

/// Rs.
let rs: [R] = [{ x: 1 }]

test "t" {
  expect 1 == 1
}
-- want --
[exit 1]
[stdout]
warning[W4001]  a/a.canon:5:8
  1 value was not evaluated or checked because a.R is broken: fix the errors in it or in the types it names

error[E2102]  a/a.canon:7:6
  unknown name Missing

error[E3008]  a/a.canon:14:10
  cannot infer the type of this expression; add a type

2 errors, 1 warning in 1 package (…)

FAIL  a/a.canon:13  t
  a/a.canon:14  error[E3008]  cannot infer the type of this expression; add a type

0 passed, 1 failed (…)
[stderr]
